<view class="demo" wx:if="{{demo}}">本地演示活动，仅用于体验</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="hero"><view class="hero-ring"></view><view class="hero-title"><view>好物限时</view><view>如约而至</view></view><view class="hero-note">一份期待，一场门店相遇</view><view class="hero-ticket">你的快闪入场券</view></view><view class="page"><view class="row"><view class="brand">{{storeName}}</view><text class="link" bindtap="my">我的预约 ›</text></view><view class="sub">挑一场喜欢的活动，留一个见面的名额。</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{events}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="open" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="row"><text class="title">{{item.name}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.phaseText}}</text></view><view class="sub">{{item.location}}</view><view class="sub">{{item.releaseText}} 开抢 · 共 {{item.total}} 个名额</view><text class="tag" wx:if="{{item.demo}}">演示</text></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{loaded &amp;&amp; !events.length}}"><view class="empty-title">期待下一场相遇</view><view>活动正在准备中，发布后会显示在这里。</view></view><view class="note">门店预约 · 到店核销 · 如约相见</view><view class="note link" bindtap="privacy">隐私与预约说明</view></view>
